   "id": 7610173063245,
   "title": "Finca El Puente - Honey Processed",
   "handle": "finca-el-puente-honey",
   "body_html": "<p>We met Marysabel Caballero and Mois\u00e9s Herrera, the owners of Finca El Puente, in 2005. They have become like family to Counter Culture, and their constant pursuit of coffee perfection inspires us year after year. This year\u2019s harvest has rich notes of blackberry and chocolate, accented by an apricot acidity.</p>\n<p>Pronunciation: FEEN-ka el PWEHN-teh</p>",
