   "title": "The Breville Bambino\u2122",
   "handle": "the-bambino\u2122",
   "body_html": "<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>The faster way to professional results at home. Like professional machines, the Bambino can deliver third-wave specialty coffee. This is made possible by the 4-key formula. Delivering barista quality performance using a 54mm portafilter with 18 grams of coffee for full flavor and a powerful steam wand to create microfoam required for latte art. With a proprietary ThermoJet heating system, the machine is ready to start in 3 seconds.\u00a0</span></p>\n<p><span>Special Offer! Buy one Bambino and get the first order free on a Blend Box subscription using code: <strong>Probarista (must add both to cart)</strong></span></p>",
