   "id": 7612982231117,
   "title": "Heavyweight Hoodie",
   "handle": "bone-heavyweight-hoodie",
   "body_html": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>A clean, modern classic. This heavyweight pullover hoodie features an oversized fit with dropped shoulders and no drawcord for a minimal, deconstructed look. Made from a soft yet durable 10oz fleece, it\u2019s finished with a dark brown embroidered </span><span>Counter Culture</span><span> logo on the chest and a woven logo tag at the front left waist. Super cozy and perfectly suited for slow mornings and chilly days.</span><b></b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Sizes S - 3XL</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>10 oz (330 gm) cotton/polyester blend 3-end fleece</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>70% Ring-spun Cotton / 30% Polyester</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Boxy fit with drop shoulder</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>No drawcord</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Blindstitch sewing on all seams for an understated, simplified design</span></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Sewn woven label on waistband</span></li>\n<li>Hoodie made by Independent Trading Co and embroidered by Durham-based Inkfinity Printing</li>\n</ul>",
