   "handle": "throwback-logo-hat-copy",
   "body_html": "<p dir=\"ltr\">Get that dang sun out of your eyes with our Skywriter Surf Cap, featuring a charming vintage airplane skywriter, shouting out our favorite summer beverage. The lightweight, quick-dry material makes this hat the perfect companion for floating down the river, avoiding splashes in the pool, or just looking and staying cool all summer.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<span><strong>Color</strong>:</span><span> Hydro blue with white printing</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material:</strong><span> Lightweight 100% recycled nylon, quick-dry fabric</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Fit:</strong><span> Mid-profile, single panel on front, slightly curved bill</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Details:</strong><span> Plastic adjustable snapback, one size fits most</span>\n</li>\n</ul>",
